---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="城北情報大学" description="AI時代の学問と社会を再構築する城北情報大学の公式サイトです。">
<section class="">
<!-- Hero Banner -->
<div class="relative bg-dark h-[80vh] min-h-[600px] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden">
<img alt="Campus View" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30 mix-blend-multiply" src="https://placehold.co/1920x1080/1e3a8a/ffffff?text=Academic+Excellence"/>
<div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-dark/90 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
<div class="relative z-10 text-center px-4 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
<p class="text-secondary font-bold tracking-[0.2em] mb-4 text-sm md:text-base uppercase">Johoku Information University</p>
<h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-serif font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-8 drop-shadow-lg">
<br class="hidden md:block"/>社会の枠をはみ出し、<br/>
<br class="hidden md:block"/>無限の可能性を育め。
                    </h2>
<div class="w-24 h-1 bg-secondary mx-auto mb-8"></div>
<!-- Global Slogan -->
<div class="inline-block bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/20 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-xl">
<h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-serif text-white mb-2 tracking-widest">Global Slogan</h3>
<div class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-200 to-white tracking-widest">
                            J.O.K.E
                        </div>
<div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 text-gray-200 text-sm md:text-base font-medium">
<span>Joyful</span><span class="opacity-50">/</span>
<span>Open</span><span class="opacity-50">/</span>
<span>Knowledge</span><span class="opacity-50">/</span>
<span>Explore</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- News & Topics -->
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20">
<div class="flex justify-between items-end mb-10 border-b pb-4">
<h3 class="text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-primary">News &amp; Topics</h3>
<a class="text-sm font-medium text-secondary hover:underline" href="#">一覧を見る →</a>
</div>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
<!-- News Item 1 -->
<article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<img alt="News Image" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" src="https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/475569?text=Research"/>
<div class="p-6">
<time class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">2026.08.20</time>
<span class="ml-3 inline-block px-2 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-primary text-[10px] rounded">研究発表</span>
<h4 class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight">システム農学部研究チームが次世代スマートアグリカルチャーに関する論文を発表</h4>
</div>
</article>
<!-- News Item 2 -->
<article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<img alt="News Image" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" src="https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/475569?text=Symposium"/>
<div class="p-6">
<time class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">2026.08.15</time>
<span class="ml-3 inline-block px-2 py-1 bg-green-100 text-green-800 text-[10px] rounded">イベント</span>
<h4 class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight">【参加者募集】情報法経学部主催「デジタル経済と法の未来」シンポジウム開催のお知らせ</h4>
</div>
</article>
<!-- News Item 3 -->
<article class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-100 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<img alt="News Image" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" src="https://placehold.co/600x400/e2e8f0/475569?text=Open+Campus"/>
<div class="p-6">
<time class="text-xs text-gray-500 font-medium">2026.08.01</time>
<span class="ml-3 inline-block px-2 py-1 bg-red-100 text-red-800 text-[10px] rounded">入試情報</span>
<h4 class="mt-3 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight">秋季オープンキャンパスの事前予約受付を開始しました</h4>
</div>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</Layout>
